      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">The most consistent need we address in Leighton is crawlspace mold inspection and remediation in older homes. The combination of Tennessee River humidity, older crawlspace construction, and clay soil that holds moisture against foundation walls creates conditions that build toward mold growth over 20–40 years without visible interior symptoms. Homeowners in Leighton who schedule a crawlspace inspection often discover they had a mold issue they weren't aware of — and that the remediation we complete materially improves the indoor air quality of their home.</p>
